OL,3,GNEWSAHeatwaves and drought lead to
OL,4,Aearly grape harvest
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile farmers across the south of
OL,7,FEngland count the cost of the hot, dry
OL,8,Fsummer, some growers say they have
OL,9,Fbenefited from the heatwave.
OL,11,FVineyards are reporting their earliest
OL,12,Fharvest on record, with the intense
OL,13,Fsummer sun producing grapes that are
OL,14,Fmuch higher in sugar.
OL,16,FSimon Priestman, of Little Waddon
OL,17,FVineyard near Weymouth, Dorset, said
OL,18,Fhis vines had "done extremely well" and
OL,19,Fanticipated an "incredibly amazing
OL,20,Ftasting wine this vintage".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
