OL,3,GNEWSAHeatwaves and drought lead to
OL,4,Aearly grape harvest
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Girling, of Setley Ridge Vineyard
OL,7,Fin Brockenhurst, Hampshire, says his
OL,8,Fteam is on track for an early end to
OL,9,Fharvest, having begun weeks earlier
OL,10,Fthan usual.
